    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Best on skyblock servers wtih cobble generator that spawn various ore



  -  Fill in all 9 slots with the iron pickaxe

  -  Stand in front of the cobble generator and start it

  -  It will automatically switch to another pickaxe when the pickaxe you are holding will break

  -  If the last pickaxe breaks, macro will stop

--------------------------------------------

Only works with the setting: 

GUI Scale: Normal
No texture packs

--------------------------------------------



It's important that hungry bar is full


If there will be downloads, I will add auto feed

Screen res: 1960x1080</Description>
